Some bundled skills under skills/ are derived from third-party security
research and tooling documentation. Each skill retains its own attribution
in its SKILL.md frontmatter or body where the upstream requires it. Skills
are treated as untrusted code by the harness: they are scanned on install,
their scripts only run inside the sandbox, and every action still passes
through the PolicyEngine.

Skill format follows the Agent Skills specification (https://agentskills.io).
